# Network loader: join Wi-Fi from the serial console (wifi-join), fetch a
# kernel over HTTP from the PC and kexec it (netload). Uniprocessor, so that
# kexec needs no CPU hotplug: CPU 1 stays in the boot ROM for the next
# kernel, which starts it the usual way.
# CONFIG_SMP is not set
# m1-ignore: CONFIG_NR_CPUS
CONFIG_KEXEC=y
CONFIG_PACKET=y
